      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "In 1886 settlers from Fort Collins, Colorado founded Collins at the mouth of Sheep Creek, about a mile north of present Morrill.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3,
