      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Morrill’s economy shifted to potato shipping in the 1920s and bean processing by Kelley Bean Co., alongside grain and fertilizer operations.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
